# 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

## 1.1 Product Overview

KEA PARROT is a web-first social discovery and micro-entertainment platform that transforms idle moments into opportunities for discovery, participation, entertainment and human connection.

The platform enables users to:

- Discover interesting conversations and activities.
- Publish anonymous or attributed content.
- Participate in real-time polls.
- Play short interactive games.
- Discover trending conversations and global activities.
- Participate in community challenges.
- Discover location-associated digital content.
- Build a digital identity through achievements and contributions.

KEA PARROT is not intended to become another conventional social media platform built primarily around followers, influencers and passive content consumption.

Its central philosophy is:

**Every idle moment should offer an opportunity to discover, participate, contribute or play.**

## 1.2 Product Vision

Become the world's most accessible platform for spontaneous digital and real-world social experiences.

## 1.3 Product Mission

Transform everyday idle moments into meaningful discoveries, entertainment and human connections through lightweight, interactive and accessible experiences.

## 1.4 Product Positioning

KEA PARROT is an instant social discovery platform combining real-time community activity, anonymous participation, location-aware discovery and bite-sized entertainment.

## 1.5 Core Product Promise

A user should be able to open KEA PARROT, discover something interesting and participate in an experience within seconds.

## 1.6 Primary Product Pillars

KEA PARROT consists of five interconnected product pillars:

1. DISCOVER — Social discovery.
2. INTERACT — Real-time participation.
3. PLAY — Micro-entertainment.
4. EXPLORE — Digital footprints and location-based discovery.
5. EVOLVE — Personal progression and achievements.

