# 11. MICRO-GAMES MODULE

Module ID: GAME

## 11.1 Purpose

Provide quick entertainment that can be completed within short idle periods.

## 11.2 Initial Games

The MVP contains exactly three games.

### GAME-001: QuickMind

Type: Trivia.

Rules:

- Five questions per standard round.
- Multiple-choice answers.
- One accepted answer per question.
- Score calculated from correct answers.
- Completion summary.
- Shareable result.

Questions must come from approved game content.

### GAME-002: This or That

Type: Binary preference challenge.

Rules:

- Present two choices.
- User selects one.
- Show relevant aggregate community results where available.
- Allow progression through a defined round.
- Show completion summary.
- Allow sharing.

### GAME-003: Mystery Word

Type: Word guessing.

Rules:

- Display a hidden word challenge.
- Provide approved clues.
- Validate guesses.
- Enforce attempt limits.
- Calculate score.
- Display completion summary.
- Allow sharing.

Exact game difficulty, clue count, scoring weights and attempt limits must be established in the game configuration before release.

## 11.3 Game Sessions

Requirement: GAME-004.

Each game session must record:

- User ID (registered users) or guest-session reference (guests; guest game scores are not saved to a profile and do not appear on leaderboards).
- Game ID.
- Start timestamp.
- Completion timestamp.
- Score.
- Session status.
- Relevant answer or attempt records.

Game submissions must be validated server-side.

Do not trust client-calculated scores.

## 11.4 Game Integrity

Requirement: GAME-005.

- Prevent duplicate session submissions.
- Validate question identifiers.
- Validate answer identifiers.
- Enforce game-session state transitions.
- Apply request rate limits.
- Prevent score manipulation.
- Record suspicious activity.

## 11.5 Game Results

Requirement: GAME-006.

Display:

- Game title.
- Final score.
- Correct answers where relevant.
- Completion time.
- Personal best, when available.
- Shareable result URL.

Do not implement cash rewards or financial wagering.

