Weekly Meaningful Interactions (WMI).

Definition:

The number of unique users completing meaningful interactions with other users or user-generated experiences during a seven-day period.

Qualifying interactions:

- Poll participation.
- Meaningful content contribution.
- Comment submission.
- Game completion.
- Challenge participation, when introduced.

Passive page views do not qualify.

