Canonical DoD: KEA-RDY-006 §17 (merged 2026-11-20) — that section holds the single canonical Definition of Done (28 checkboxes, the union of this document's list and KEA-TPR-005 §9). The checklist below is this document's PRD-specific view of it and must not be read as a competing DoD.

